---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13615550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(361) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Ants in Kitchen Victoria TX | Fast Ant Control" description="Ants marching across your kitchen counter in Victoria, TX? We locate the colony and eliminate the source.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Ants in Kitchen</div>
      <h1>Ants in the Kitchen</h1>
      <p>Those lines of ants mean a larger colony is nearby. We stop them at the source.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Why Kitchen Ants Keep Coming Back</h2>
      <p>Wiping the counter removes the visible ants but not the colony. Scouts leave scent trails that bring more workers. Until the nest is addressed and entry points reduced, the problem returns.</p>
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Identify the ant species</li>
        <li>Follow trails to find entry points and outdoor nests</li>
        <li>Apply targeted baits and residual treatments</li>
        <li>Advise on food storage and moisture control</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Stop Kitchen Ants Today</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
